{"t": 5441, "caller": "analyst", "tool": "msg.send", "args": {"to": "checker", "body": "West/Q4 records for spot-check:\nr40-7cb4 | West | Q4 | Dana Whitfield | dana.w@pinegrove.example | refunded=yes | 244.10\nr41-7cb4 | West | Q4 | Ezra Kaminski | ekaminski@ridgeline.example | refunded=yes | 178.65\nr42-7cb4 | West | Q4 | Aurelie Boucher | a.boucher@calderon.example | refunded=no | 96.40\nr43-7cb4 | West | Q4 | Hyun-woo Baek | hw.baek@stillwater.example | refunded=yes | 530.00\nr44-7cb4 | West | Q4 | Fatima Zahra El Idrissi | f.elidrissi@juniperbay.example | refunded=no | 72.85\nr45-7cb4 | West | Q4 | Ronan Mcgillivray | ronan@thornfield.example | refunded=yes | 209.30\nResult: 4/6 refunded = 66.7%. West/Q3 and East/Q4 reads returned no rows, so quarter-over-quarter change cannot be calculated. Please review proposed client reply: \u201cWest\u2019s Q4 refund rate was 66.7% (4 of 6), 6.7 percentage points above East\u2019s Q3 rate of 60%. There are no West/Q3 or East/Q4 records in the table, so I can\u2019t determine a like-for-like regional comparison or whether either region changed in Q4.\u201d"}, "ok": true}
